      program="pia"
  />

  <!-- FAQ Section -->
  <FAQSection faqs={faqs}/>

  <!-- Recommendation -->
  <h2 id="recommendation">Which Should You Choose?</h2>
  <p>
    Our recommendation is straightforward:
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>For remote work: Use a paid VPN.</strong> The security, reliability, and features justify
    the $2-5/month cost. Your data, your clients' data, and your professional reputation are worth
    more than a coffee per month.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Our top pick:</strong> NordVPN offers the best combination of security, speed, and features
    at $3.39/month. Surfshark is excellent if budget is tight at $2.49/month with unlimited devices.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>If you must use free:</strong> ProtonVPN's free tier is the only free VPN we'd recommend
    for anything beyond trivial use. It's genuinely private and secure—just limited.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Never use:</strong> Random free VPNs from app stores, especially those with no clear company
    behind them or privacy policies that mention data collection. The risks far outweigh any savings.
  </p>
  <p>
    All paid VPNs we recommend offer 30-day money-back guarantees. Try one risk-free and see the
    difference for yourself.
  </p>

  <AffiliateButton
      href="/go/nordvpn"
      text="Get NordVPN — 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee"
      variant="primary"
      program="nordvpn"
  />

  <!-- Related Articles -->
  <Fragment slot="full-width">
    <RelatedArticles articles={relatedArticles}/>
  </Fragment>
</ArticleLayout>
